==German==

===Etymology===
Originally from Northern Germany, has today mostly replaced the older ''-lein''.

===Suffix===
'''-chen'''

# the most common German suffix to create a diminutive form, eg. ''[[Hund]]'' -> ''Hünd'''chen'''''.

